%% title: InspectionReport Version Lifecycle State Machine Diagram
stateDiagram-v2
  direction LR
  [*] --> RPT_DRAFT : createDraft (AI / Manual) [FR-13]
  RPT_DRAFT --> AUTHOR_VERIFIED : verifyAsAuthor(partial unique index) [FR-13]
  AUTHOR_VERIFIED --> SUBMITTED : submit(partial unique index) [FR-13]
  SUBMITTED --> RPT_DRAFT : withdraw(partial unique index) (before review) [FR-13]
  SUBMITTED --> RETURNED : reviewBy(approve=false, reason) [FR-14]
  RETURNED --> AUTHOR_VERIFIED : verifyAsAuthor(partial unique index) (after edit) [FR-13]
  SUBMITTED --> APPROVED : reviewBy(approve=true) [FR-14]
  APPROVED --> PUBLISHED : publish(partial unique index) (renders PDF to MinIO) [FR-14]
  PUBLISHED --> SUPERSEDED : newer version PUBLISHED [FR-14]
  PUBLISHED --> [*]
  SUPERSEDED --> [*]
